    {"id": 3, "claim": "In the face of new challenging evidence, the standard scientific procedure is to test if the theory can be adjusted to accommodate the data.", "evidence": "Standard scientific practice involves refining models (modification) before discarding them.", "weight": 0.30, "depends_on": [1, 2]},
